Here is the commit message:
ND2: fix string indexing bug introduced in b48fd4a

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by an attempt to access the last character of a `StringBuffer` without checking if it was empty, which could lead to a `StringIndexOutOfBoundsException`. This situation arose when the `StringBuffer` was constructed from an empty string or when the loop continued without appending any valid strings, resulting in an empty buffer at the time of the check.

